  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Lay tortillas on a flat surface. Using a spatula, spread peanut butter evenly over one side of each tortilla."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel bananas and place one on the side of each tortilla. Roll the tortilla up around the banana and slice into pieces."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and halve strawberries."
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide rolls and strawberries onto plates. Enjoy!"
